WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.000
-Welcome, welcome, welcome to
"The Tonight Show."

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.200
This is it. You're here.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.267
You made it.
"The Tonight Show."

00:00:06.267 --> 00:00:08.634
Thank you for watching.

00:00:08.634 --> 00:00:11.567
Well, guys, today, President
Biden unveiled a new Website

00:00:11.567 --> 00:00:13.601
called covid.gov

00:00:13.601 --> 00:00:16.534
where people can go for masks,
test kits,

00:00:16.534 --> 00:00:18.300
vaccines,
and treatment information.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:21.334
The COVID site's got everything
you need -- tests, masks,

00:00:21.334 --> 00:00:22.601
and a list of excuses

00:00:22.601 --> 00:00:24.400
to get out of your friend's
destination wedding.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:25.834
[ Laughter ]

00:00:25.834 --> 00:00:28.534
"I know restrictions are lifted,
but, uh, yeah, I don't know."

00:00:29.534 --> 00:00:31.501
If you haven't seen the new
COVID site, here it is.

00:00:32.434 --> 00:00:33.267
Yeah.

00:00:33.267 --> 00:00:34.467
And just to make it

00:00:34.467 --> 00:00:35.667
look more trustworthy
for your crazy uncle,

00:00:35.667 --> 00:00:37.400
there's a beta version
that looks like this.

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:40.100
-♪ And I'm proud
to be an American ♪

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:41.334
-Ah, I trust that one.

00:00:41.334 --> 00:00:42.834
-♪ Where at least I know
I'm free ♪

00:00:42.834 --> 00:00:44.501
That's a Website I can trust.

00:00:44.501 --> 00:00:47.534
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.534 --> 00:00:49.634
That's right, Biden announced
the new COVID Website,

00:00:49.634 --> 00:00:52.234
and then he sat down to get
his second booster shot.

00:00:52.234 --> 00:00:53.467
-Ooh.

00:00:53.467 --> 00:00:55.567
-Right after Biden's doctor said
he needed a boost,

00:00:55.567 --> 00:00:57.634
his poll numbers were like,
"Tell me about it."

00:00:57.634 --> 00:01:00.100
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:02.434
Biden said
the shot felt wonderful.

00:01:03.934 --> 00:01:05.067
Based on the current news,

00:01:05.067 --> 00:01:06.467
there's a chance
getting stuck with a needle

00:01:06.467 --> 00:01:08.200
really was the best part
of his day.

00:01:09.434 --> 00:01:10.868
It actually got
a little awkward.

00:01:10.868 --> 00:01:12.601
After he rolled up his sleeve,
Biden said,

00:01:12.601 --> 00:01:14.467
"Looks like inflation also
hit these pythons."

00:01:14.467 --> 00:01:16.968
[ Laughter ]

00:01:16.968 --> 00:01:19.200
[ Smooches ]

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:20.934
Meanwhile, I read
that over in Russia,

00:01:20.934 --> 00:01:23.100
Putin's senior advisors
have been giving him

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:25.033
false information about the war

00:01:25.033 --> 00:01:27.834
because they're, "too afraid
to tell him the truth."

00:01:27.834 --> 00:01:29.033
-Ooh.

00:01:29.033 --> 00:01:30.667
-You'd think his advisors
would be more comfortable

00:01:30.667 --> 00:01:31.734
telling him the truth.

00:01:31.734 --> 00:01:33.300
I mean, they've always seemed
so close.

00:01:33.300 --> 00:01:34.367
Look at this.

00:01:34.367 --> 00:01:35.801
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.801 --> 00:01:37.033
Same table.

00:01:38.834 --> 00:01:39.701
It's getting crazy.

00:01:39.701 --> 00:01:41.067
Today Putin left a meeting like,

00:01:41.067 --> 00:01:43.334
"I can't believe
I'm sexiest man alive.

00:01:43.334 --> 00:01:45.200
I can't believe I --

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:46.901
This is unbelievable.
Third year in a row."

00:01:46.901 --> 00:01:49.968
[ Laughter ]

00:01:49.968 --> 00:01:51.334
Here's a wild story.

00:01:51.334 --> 00:01:52.934
Republican lawmakers are furious

00:01:52.934 --> 00:01:55.334
at fellow Republican
Madison Cawthorn

00:01:55.334 --> 00:01:56.868
after he went on a podcast

00:01:56.868 --> 00:01:58.834
and said that his colleagues
in Washington

00:01:58.834 --> 00:02:01.667
like to have drug-fueled
sex parties.

00:02:01.667 --> 00:02:02.934
[ Audience murmurs ]

00:02:02.934 --> 00:02:04.434
Of course,
Congressional Republicans

00:02:04.434 --> 00:02:05.567
are denying the whole thing.

00:02:05.567 --> 00:02:07.234
And many of them
even put out statements.

00:02:07.234 --> 00:02:08.934
First, Congressman Kevin
McCarthy said...

00:02:10.834 --> 00:02:13.100
Next up, Congressman
Steve Scalise said...

00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:19.300
[ Laughter ]

00:02:19.300 --> 00:02:21.300
And finally,
Congressman Billy Long said...

00:02:26.801 --> 00:02:29.801
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:32.467 --> 00:02:33.901
Well, some business news.

00:02:33.901 --> 00:02:38.000
Amazon has been secretly testing
its drone delivery program.

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:40.634
And this year, they plan
to drop packages from the sky

00:02:40.634 --> 00:02:42.701
to more than 1,000 customers.

00:02:42.701 --> 00:02:43.801
Yeah.

00:02:43.801 --> 00:02:45.067
Pretty soon,
at Amazon headquarters,

00:02:45.067 --> 00:02:46.667
they're going to be like,
"Target acquired.

00:02:46.667 --> 00:02:49.167
Release the Fruit of the Loom
three-pack right now."

00:02:49.167 --> 00:02:50.534
Yeah.

00:02:50.534 --> 00:02:52.133
Meanwhile, if you choose
three-day shipping,

00:02:52.133 --> 00:02:55.567
the packages fall to Earth
much, much slower.

00:02:55.567 --> 00:02:58.567
The drone program
is called Prime Air.

00:02:58.567 --> 00:02:59.868
Prime Air.

00:02:59.868 --> 00:03:01.934
That actually sounds more like
a fancy bottle of oxygen

00:03:01.934 --> 00:03:04.200
they try to sell on
"Shark Tank."

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:06.000
"Hi, Sharks."

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:08.534
I heard about a man in Ohio
who was robbed,

00:03:08.534 --> 00:03:10.567
but the thief had
a very interesting approach.

00:03:10.567 --> 00:03:11.667
Listen to this.

00:03:11.667 --> 00:03:13.634
-The victim told police
he was approached

00:03:13.634 --> 00:03:16.968
by a man in a ski mask
holding a pocket knife.

00:03:16.968 --> 00:03:18.467
The robber demanded cash

00:03:18.467 --> 00:03:21.000
and made the victim
pinky promise

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:24.534
he wouldn't report the robbery
before riding off on a bicycle.

00:03:24.534 --> 00:03:26.634
[ Laughter ]

00:03:27.934 --> 00:03:29.367
-What?

00:03:29.367 --> 00:03:30.801
-When the victim handed
over the money,

00:03:30.801 --> 00:03:32.601
the thief said,
"Hey, I didn't say 'Simon says'!

00:03:32.601 --> 00:03:33.667
Hey!"

00:03:34.901 --> 00:03:36.667
Can we see
the getaway vehicle?

00:03:36.667 --> 00:03:37.601
Oh, yeah, that makes sense.
-Oh.

00:03:37.601 --> 00:03:39.033
-Yeah.

00:03:39.033 --> 00:03:40.234
That makes sense.

00:03:40.234 --> 00:03:41.901
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:46.100
And finally,
a mall in New Jersey

00:03:46.100 --> 00:03:47.634
has a new vending machine

00:03:47.634 --> 00:03:49.634
that you can make a burger
in six minutes.

00:03:49.634 --> 00:03:51.300
-Ooh.
-Here it is. Look at this thing.

00:03:51.300 --> 00:03:52.501
Yeah.

00:03:52.501 --> 00:03:53.734
That's great,
'cause before this,

00:03:53.734 --> 00:03:56.133
getting a burger
was so time-consuming.

00:03:56.133 --> 00:03:57.868
[ Laughter ]

00:03:57.868 --> 00:03:59.534
Seriously, how fast
do you need a burger

00:03:59.534 --> 00:04:01.067
when you look at McDonald's
and you go,

00:04:01.067 --> 00:04:03.300
"I don't have time for that"?

00:04:03.300 --> 00:04:05.167
Yeah, but it makes burgers
and doesn't talk.

00:04:05.167 --> 00:04:07.234
It's basically your dad
every Fourth of July.

00:04:07.234 --> 00:04:08.534
You guys, we have a great show.

00:04:08.534 --> 00:04:10.367
Give it up for The Roots,
everybody.

00:04:10.367 --> 00:04:11.934
-♪ The man at hand
that rule the school ♪

00:04:11.934 --> 00:04:15.033
♪ And reach and teach the blind
and find a way from A to Z ♪

00:04:15.033 --> 00:04:17.167
♪ To reach the most
and boast loud and proud ♪

00:04:17.167 --> 00:04:19.667
♪ The gain and vein of a main,
do that thang ♪

00:04:19.667 --> 00:04:21.634
♪ When the heat is on,
you feel a fire ♪

00:04:21.634 --> 00:04:24.567
♪ From the Empire on a more
higher level of depth ♪

00:04:24.567 --> 00:04:26.467
♪ One step for young ♪

00:04:26.467 --> 00:04:27.734
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:27.734 --> 00:04:31.467
-Yeah!
That's right, what a show!

00:04:31.467 --> 00:04:33.400
What a show we have
for you tonight.

00:04:33.400 --> 00:04:35.434
He's currently on his new
standup tour

00:04:35.434 --> 00:04:37.334
called "The King's Jester."

00:04:37.334 --> 00:04:39.734
Hasan Minhaj is here tonight.
-Yeah!

00:04:39.734 --> 00:04:41.033
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:41.033 --> 00:04:43.567
-Funny, funny, funny dude.

00:04:43.567 --> 00:04:47.100
Plus, he's the WWE
Universal Champion,

00:04:47.100 --> 00:04:48.667
and you can see him
at "Wrestlemania,"

00:04:48.667 --> 00:04:51.901
which begins streaming
Saturday night on Peacock.

00:04:51.901 --> 00:04:54.667
Roman Reigns is here tonight!

00:04:54.667 --> 00:04:56.834
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:56.834 --> 00:04:58.801
He's the best.

00:04:58.801 --> 00:04:59.934
And we got great music

00:04:59.934 --> 00:05:02.434
from Mimi Webb,
ladies and gentlemen!

00:05:04.167 --> 00:05:07.200
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:08.968
Fun show.
It's a great show.

00:05:08.968 --> 00:05:11.000
We actually had a great show
last night.

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:12.767
Jared Leto was here.

00:05:12.767 --> 00:05:16.501
His new Marvel movie "Morbius"
is out this weekend.

00:05:16.501 --> 00:05:18.334
I'm always blown away
by how he's able

00:05:18.334 --> 00:05:20.968
to disappear into his roles.

00:05:20.968 --> 00:05:22.200
Really, it's amazing.

00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:24.334
Actually, something happened
amazing last night

00:05:24.334 --> 00:05:26.267
when Jared was here,
right before the show.

00:05:26.267 --> 00:05:27.667
-Really?
-Yeah, check this out.

00:05:29.334 --> 00:05:30.434
Hey, Jared.

00:05:30.434 --> 00:05:31.601
I'm so excited you're on
the show tonight.

00:05:31.601 --> 00:05:33.100
I just wanted to --

00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:35.133
Oh. Sorry.

00:05:35.133 --> 00:05:36.567
I thought this was Jared's room.

00:05:36.567 --> 00:05:37.467
-It is.

00:05:37.467 --> 00:05:39.133
-What do you mean?

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:43.267
-Ahh.

00:05:43.267 --> 00:05:45.868
-What?
-I was just in character.

00:05:45.868 --> 00:05:47.801
-That's incredible.

00:05:47.801 --> 00:05:49.100
You really disappear
into your roles.

00:05:49.100 --> 00:05:51.100
I was going to say,
I just saw "Morbius,"

00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:52.801
and I barely recognized you
at first.

00:05:52.801 --> 00:05:54.701
-I appreciate that.
I really do.

00:05:54.701 --> 00:05:56.000
-Hey, Jimmy.
What's going on?

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:57.100
-Oh, hey, Higgins.

00:05:57.100 --> 00:05:59.000
I was just saying hi to Jared.
-Jared?

00:05:59.868 --> 00:06:02.000
There's nobody in here with you.
-What do you mean?

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:03.834
[ Suspenseful music plays ]

00:06:03.834 --> 00:06:05.200
Where'd he go?

00:06:05.200 --> 00:06:06.767
-[ Sighs ]

00:06:06.767 --> 00:06:07.767
I'm right here.

00:06:07.767 --> 00:06:09.934
-A-Again, unrecognizable.

00:06:09.934 --> 00:06:11.667
I don't even understand
how you do it.

00:06:11.667 --> 00:06:12.634
It's so good.

00:06:12.634 --> 00:06:14.367
-I'm just kidding.

00:06:14.367 --> 00:06:16.234
It was really me.
-Oh.

00:06:16.234 --> 00:06:17.834
-[ Grunts ]

00:06:17.834 --> 00:06:19.167
Got you again.

00:06:19.167 --> 00:06:20.734
-I can't believe it.

00:06:20.734 --> 00:06:23.868
Y-You were Jared
pretending to be Higgins

00:06:23.868 --> 00:06:27.133
pretending to be Jared
pretending to be Higgins?

00:06:27.133 --> 00:06:30.267
Almost. But -- But no. I --

00:06:30.267 --> 00:06:31.601
I'm not Jared.

00:06:31.601 --> 00:06:33.367
-Then who are you?

00:06:34.334 --> 00:06:35.467
-I'm Jimmy.

00:06:35.467 --> 00:06:37.734
-Then that makes me --

00:06:37.734 --> 00:06:39.501
-Yep.

00:06:39.501 --> 00:06:41.133
-[ Sighs ]

00:06:41.133 --> 00:06:42.801
Jared.

00:06:42.801 --> 00:06:43.801
-Incredible.

00:06:43.801 --> 00:06:45.267
-Not too bad yourself.

00:06:45.267 --> 00:06:46.367
-Thank you.

00:06:46.367 --> 00:06:48.534
So, wait, where is Higgins?

00:06:48.534 --> 00:06:50.334
[ Tariq rapping ]

00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:53.901
-My first guest
stars in "Morbius."

00:06:53.901 --> 00:06:56.100
Give it up for Jared Leto!

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:58.133
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:58.133 --> 00:06:59.634
♪♪

00:06:59.634 --> 00:07:01.400
[ Higgins laughing ]

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:02.501
-You know what?

00:07:02.501 --> 00:07:03.501
Let him have it.

00:07:03.501 --> 00:07:05.167
Want to grab a bite?

00:07:05.167 --> 00:07:06.133
-Thought you'd never ask.

00:07:06.133 --> 00:07:07.167
[ Hisses ]

00:07:07.167 --> 00:07:09.133
-♪ The jig is up,
the news is out ♪

00:07:09.133 --> 00:07:11.400
♪ They've finally found me ♪

00:07:11.400 --> 00:07:12.968
♪ The renegade... ♪

